    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d187">

                <pb facs="0262" n="154" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg154"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Young to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States,<lb/>Guatemala and
                                Honduras</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">La
                            Libertad</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1893-11-09"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">November 9, 1893</hi></date>. (Received
                        November 10.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Have demanded to be informed if Honduras Government authorized firing on the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Costa Rica</hi>. Am here on <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Alliance</hi> waiting reply. Had I authority would make short work of this
                    matter. I await your instructions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Young</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
